==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|a|s}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fiu-fin-pro|fi}} {{m|fiu-fin-pro|*acja}}, possibly of {{etyl|gem|fi}} origin. Cognates include Estonian {{term|asi|lang=et}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈɑsiɑ]|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|a|si|a|lang=fi}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[thing]], [[matter]], [[issue]], [[business]]
#: ''Kuuntele, mitä minulla on '''asiaa'''.''
#:: ''Please listen to the '''matter''' I have to talk to you about.''
#: ''Tämä ei ole sinun '''asiasi'''!''
#:: This is none of your '''business'''!

